00:00:47.844 --> 00:00:49.260
From there, we're
going to move on

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:54.130
to talk about Vuclip's journey
to serverless data warehousing

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:56.320
and talk a little bit about
the technology choices

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.740
that they made along the way,
some of the migration process

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.320
that they put into place
some of the use cases

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.230
that they were able to
